1
00:00:00,883 --> 00:00:02,583
Previously
on The Big Bang Theory...

2
00:00:02,686 --> 00:00:06,146
There's no point in dwelling on it.
As the Vulcans say,

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:10,020
"Kup-fun-tor
ha'kiv na'ish Du stau."

4
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:13,490
Do you know what that means?
No.

5
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:14,720
Are you telling the truth?

6
00:00:14,725 --> 00:00:16,495
Nersh.

7
00:00:18,127 --> 00:00:20,567
This is ridiculous... being upset
about Amy all the time

8
00:00:20,564 --> 00:00:21,764
isn't accomplishing anything.

9
00:00:21,765 --> 00:00:23,665
If I want to resolve
this situation,

10
00:00:23,667 --> 00:00:25,267
then I need to take action.

11
00:00:25,269 --> 00:00:27,499
What are you gonna do?
I'm going to find her

12
00:00:27,504 --> 00:00:28,604
and ask her to marry me.

13
00:00:28,606 --> 00:00:30,276
And if she says yes,

14
00:00:30,274 --> 00:00:32,944
we can put this behind us
and resume our relationship.

15
00:00:32,943 --> 00:00:34,513
And if she says no...

16
00:00:34,511 --> 00:00:37,951
well, then she
can just ponfo miran.

17
00:00:40,483 --> 00:01:06,023
He didn't mean that.

